Cache launch-time RSX audit/index and SPU job diagnostics per host thread.
The disabled paths otherwise scan the process environment for each method
or job. Preserve presence-based switches, descriptor dump levels, selected
fingerprints and existing log budgets. Keep initialization private to each
thread and use the compiler TLS spelling supported by MSVC/clang-cl or GCC.

